<title>DENMARK: Danish NKT Holding profits climb in 1996.</title>
<headline>Danish NKT Holding profits climb in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net result after minorities	108  vs  41</p>
<p> Pre-tax &amp; extra. items result    249  vs  154</p>
<p> Group net turnover		  4,771 vs  4,612</p>
<p> Group operating result	     304  vs  138</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent)     unchanged 12</p>
<p> Own capital end-1996	     2,494  vs  2,440 end-1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish wire and electrical cable manufacturing group is NKT Holding A/S.  </p>
<p>It said in a statement that it expected its 1997 net profit after minorities to be the same or better than in 1996. The result was slightly above NKT's own expectations.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969652</p>
</text>
